NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This MIT license covers the original probing code in this repository (the
`linear_prober.core` engine, the modality runners, the extraction adapters and
the test suite).

The per-model wrappers under `linear_prober/skeleton/models/` and
`linear_prober/mri/models/` adapt code and load checkpoints from external
foundation-model repositories, each governed by its own upstream license — in
particular 3DINO / DINOv2 / DINOv3, SAM-Med3D, MONAI VISTA3D and
BrainSegFounder. Notably, the 3DINO-derived code is subject to the upstream
CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 license (non-commercial, no derivatives). Users must comply
with each upstream license when using the corresponding model.
